        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="1118" n="982" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg982"/>

                <head>No. 687.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-11-27"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 27,
                        1888</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 135.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your No. 218 of the 3d
                    instant, reporting the judgment of the prize court in tke case of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Haytian Republic</hi> and your protest made to the
                    Haytian authorities against their action in the case.</p>
                <p>Your protest is approved as a timely reservation of all rights.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. F. Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
